  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Check out my other mod that connects Refined Storage and Cooking for Blockheads-Link at the bottom-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"精炼烹饪宣传图\" width=\"800\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Header.png\" alt=\"应用烹饪标题\" width=\"1125\" height=\"378\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available for Forge-1.19 | 1.18-edbd7e?labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Minecraft版本徽章\" width=\"266\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install on-Client & Server-edbd7e?labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"应用烹饪安装徽章\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmeloncube.net%252fsebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Promo.png\" alt=\"应用烹饪宣传图\" width=\"1808\" height=\"268\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Description.png\" alt=\"应用烹饪介绍\" width=\"1808\" height=\"179\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一款让应用能源2（Applied Energistics 2）与方块烹饪（Cooking for Blockheads）协同工作的模组！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增了一个方块：厨房工作站（Kitchen Station）！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在将厨房工作站作为CFB厨房网络的一部分放置之前，你需要像配置无线终端一样对其进行设置。对于低于1.20的Minecraft版本，你需要在AE2安全终端中进行设置。而对于1.20及以上版本，则需要在AE2无线接入点中进行设置。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">连接完成后，你就可以直接从烹饪台消耗AE2网络库存中的物品了。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Recipes.png\" alt=\"应用烹饪配方\" width=\"1808\" height=\"824\"></p>\n<h2>方块</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>&nbsp;</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>已连接</strong></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>未连接</strong></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>厨房工作站&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/19RvTpK/appliedcooking-kitchenstation-connected.png\" alt=\"厨房工作站已连接\" width=\"397\" height=\"376\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/brxMbvZ/appliedcooking-kitchenstation-disconnected.png\" alt=\"厨房工作站未连接\" width=\"430\" height=\"376\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Screenshot.png\" alt=\"应用烹饪截图\" width=\"1808\" height=\"824\"></p>\n<h2>社交链接</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/itssebastrn/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=ItsSebastrn&color=edbd7e&labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn的Curseforge主页\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fItsSebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@ItsSebastrn&color=edbd7e&labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn的X/Twitter主页\" width=\"159\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC46TYUp8WpcFub8NxuGA66A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=edbd7e&labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn的YouTube主页\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/itssebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=ItsSebastrn&color=edbd7e&labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitch&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn的Twitch主页\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=edbd7e&labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn的GitHub主页\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_RCLink.png\" alt=\"精炼烹饪宣传图\" width=\"1808\" height=\"268\"></a></p>",
